<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Pechiney.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Pechiney.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. has issued six million call warrants, in twwo equal tranches, on Pechiney stock, lead manager Citibank S.A said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   02.DEC.96		 LISTING  PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    1000</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	STRIKE    MATURITY   ISSUE    PREMIUM    GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	210 FFR   20.JAN.98  2.42 FFR 15.09 PCT  8.4 X</p>
<p> CALL	240 FFR   20.JAN.99  2.44 FFR 29.93 PCT  8.3 X</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
